eta-2\">Publish from Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"embed-the-viewer\">Embed the viewer<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#embed-the-viewer\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>The whole engine drops into any web page with one script tag. It runs in\nan iframe served from the Verse origin — which carries the\ncross-origin-isolation headers the engine needs — so <strong>your page needs no header changes</strong>, works inside any CMS block, and degrades on its own:\nWebGPU (tiers A/B) → WebGL2 (tier C) → poster image + link-out. The\nWebGL2 build streams the same scenes, and with the same studio\nlighting, shadows, bloom and reflection probes; screen-space and\nray-traced reflections, path-traced stills and Gaussian splats stay\nWebGPU-only (<a href=\"/docs/browser-support\" id=\"lnk-browser-support-3\">Browser support</a>).</p>\n<p><strong>You need:</strong> a scene id (the <code>ingest/&lt;id&gt;.vpk</code> part of a share link) and\na page you can put a <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> tag on. <code>HOST</code> is your Verse origin.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-the-one-line-embed\">1. The one-line embed<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#1-the-one-line-embed\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"html\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-html\">&lt;script src=&quot;https://HOST/embed.js&quot; data-scene=&quot;docs-demo-718035483f84&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre></div>\n<p>The viewer mounts into the script&#39;s parent element as a <code>div.verse-embed</code>\nat 16:9, filling the parent&#39;s width. Useful attributes:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Attribute</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>data-poster=&quot;poster.jpg&quot;</code></td><td>shown until the engine arrives — and if it never does (ad-blocker, offline), the poster stays</td></tr><tr><td><code>data-target=&quot;#viewer&quot;</code></td><td>mount into that element instead of the script&#39;s parent</td></tr><tr><td><code>data-vpk=&quot;…&quot;</code> / <code>data-model=&quot;…&quot;</code></td><td>a <code>.vpk</code> by URL, or a small GLB / splat loaded whole</td></tr><tr><td><code>data-render=&quot;continuous&quot;</code></td><td>opt out of on-demand rendering (embeds park when nothing changes, so a still viewer costs ~zero battery)</td></tr><tr><td><code>data-hdr=&quot;auto&quot;</code></td><td>opt in to HDR output on HDR displays; embeds default to SDR so your page&#39;s colours never shift uninvited</td></tr><tr><td><code>data-review=&quot;1&quot;</code></td><td>enable client review pins (see below)</td></tr><tr><td><code>data-share=&quot;…&quot;</code></td><td>share token for a private scene</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"2-programmatic-mount-events-and-control\">2. Programmatic mount: events and control<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#2-programmatic-mount-events-and-control\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"html\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy-2\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-html\">&lt;div id=&quot;viewer&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;script src=&quot;https://HOST/embed.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\n&lt;script&gt;\n  const viewer = Verse.embed(document.getElementById(&quot;viewer&quot;), {\n    scene: &quot;docs-demo-718035483f84&quot;,\n    poster: &quot;poster.jpg&quot;,\n  });\n  viewer\n    .on(&quot;ready&quot;,    (d) =&gt; console.log(&quot;tier&quot;, d.tier, &quot;first frame in&quot;, d.ttfi, &quot;ms&quot;))\n    .on(&quot;loaded&quot;,   (d) =&gt; console.log(d.clusters, &quot;clusters, streaming:&quot;, d.streamed))\n    .on(&quot;signed&quot;,   (s) =&gt; console.log(&quot;signature&quot;, s.signed))   // true | false | &quot;unverified&quot;\n    .on(&quot;progress&quot;, (p) =&gt; console.log(&quot;drawn&quot;, p.drawn, &quot;of&quot;, p.total))\n    .on(&quot;dwell&quot;,    (d) =&gt; analytics.track(&quot;3d-dwell&quot;, { ms: d.ms }))\n    .on(&quot;error&quot;,    (e) =&gt; console.warn(&quot;verse:&quot;, e.message));\n&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre></div>\n<p>Events already emitted are replayed to late listeners, so attaching after\n<code>ready</code> fired still delivers it. The full verb and event list — <code>walk()</code>,\n<code>move()</code>, <code>pick()</code>, <code>setSun()</code>, <code>setMaterial()</code>, <code>play()</code>, <code>goTo()</code>,\n<code>joinRoom()</code> and the rest — is the <a href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-3\">Embed SDK reference</a>;\nthe typed contract ships as <code>verse-embed.d.ts</code> next to <code>embed.js</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-a-flythrough-video-button\">3. A flythrough video button<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#3-a-flythrough-video-button\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The viewer can record its tour (the compile-time staged tour, or an orbit\nwhen the scene has none) to MP4/WebM <strong>inside the iframe</strong> and hand the\nbytes to your page. Nothing is uploaded:</p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"js\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy-3\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-js\">progress.hidden = false;\nviewer.on(&quot;export-progress&quot;, (p) =&gt; (bar.style.width = `${p.percent}%`));\nconst r = await viewer.exportVideo({ duration: 10, fps: 30, height: 1080 });\nif (!r.cancelled) {\n  const a = Object.assign(document.createElement(&quot;a&quot;), {\n    href: URL.createObjectURL(r.blob),\n    download: r.name,                       // &quot;docs-demo-718035483f84-tour.mp4&quot;\n  });\n  a.click();\n}\ncancelButton.onclick = () =&gt; viewer.cancelExport();   // resolves the promise with { cancelled: true }</code></pre></div>\n<p>Options and the message protocol for non-SDK integrations are in\n<a href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-3\">Export a flythrough video</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-review-pins-in-the-embed\">4. Review pins in the embed<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#4-review-pins-in-the-embed\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Opt in with <code>review: true</code>; there is deliberately no built-in button — your\npage decides how review mode is toggled, the same way it does for walk\nmode:</p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"js\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy-4\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-js\">const viewer = Verse.embed(el, { scene: &quot;docs-demo-718035483f84&quot;, review: true });\nreviewToggle.onclick = () =&gt; viewer.setReviewMode(reviewToggle.checked);\nviewer.on(&quot;review-posted&quot;,   (d) =&gt; console.log(&quot;new pin&quot;, d.id, d.pos, d.text));\nviewer.on(&quot;review-selected&quot;, (d) =&gt; showSidebar(d));\nconst comments = await viewer.getComments();   // [{ id, t, pos, text, author?, resolved }]</code></pre></div>\n<p>Viewers comment anonymously (an optional name field). Owner moderation —\nresolve and delete — stays in the playground and <code>/studio</code>; embeds never\nshow those controls. Details: <a href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-3\">Collect client review\ncomments</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"private-scenes\">Private scenes<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#private-scenes\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<p>A private scene needs its share token both for the bytes and for review\ncalls. Pass it once:</p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"js\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy-5\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-js\">const viewer = Verse.embed(el, {\n  vpk: &quot;ingest/docs-demo-718035483f84.vpk&quot;,\n  share: &quot;&lt;32 hex shareToken&gt;&quot;,\n  review: true,\n});</code></pre></div>\n<p>Minting tokens: <a href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-3\">Share privately with tokens</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"styling-and-layout\">Styling and layout<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#styling-and-layout\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Style <code>div.verse-embed</code> with CSS; it is a normal block element (the live\nexamples on this site set it to <code>position: absolute; inset: 0</code> inside a\n16:9 box). Remove the element to tear the viewer down. The review composer\nclamps to the iframe&#39;s bounds and scrolls internally, so embeds work down\nto 320 px wide.</p>\n<h2 id=\"try-it\">Try it<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#try-it\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-8\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/samples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-live-examples\">Live examples</a> page mounts four real embeds with the exact\nsnippet beside each one; <code>/embed-demo.html</code> is a standalone host page you\ncan view-source.</p></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#1-the-one-line-embed\" id=\"lnk-1-the-one-line-embed\">1. The one-line embed</a><a href=\"#2-programmatic-mount-events-and-control\" id=\"lnk-2-programmatic-mount-events-and-control\">2. Programmatic mount: events and control</a><a href=\"#3-a-flythrough-video-button\" id=\"lnk-3-a-flythrough-video-button\">3. A flythrough video button</a><a href=\"#4-review-pins-in-the-embed\" id=\"lnk-4-review-pins-in-the-embed\">4. Review pins in the embed</a><a href=\"#private-scenes\" id=\"lnk-private-scenes\">Private scenes</a><a href=\"#styling-and-layout\" id=\"lnk-styling-and-layout\">Styling and layout</a><a href=\"#try-it\" id=\"lnk-try-it\">Try it</a></aside></section>"}